ONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp; </span><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">사업개요 (붙임 참조)</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">사업명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: 2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">년도 월드프렌즈 청년봉사단 네팔&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">사업기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: 2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">- 11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림, gulim\